        <mxCell id="rules" value="Build rules&#xa;1. Audit and lock the 12-KPI pilot before expanding toward the 50 direct-series candidates.  2. Run DuckDB writes sequentially: series → metric → frame → turn signals.&#xa;3. Keep absolute direction distinct from relative momentum.  4. Compare 1yr and 5yr only on the same KPI panel.  5. Review exports never become a shadow data contract." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4f4;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
